[28.429855, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in \u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mapp/money.py drops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mup (for\u001b[11Gexample,\u001b[20G7% tax \u001b[28Gn 1050\u001b[35Gcents must be 74 cents, not 73). \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btests/t\u001b[11Gst_money.py pins the\u001b[32Grequir\u001b[39Gd behaviour; you can\u001b[61Gun it \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mwith \u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest tests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m. Fix it and tell\u001b[63Gme when\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit i\u001b[8G done. Do not commit; do not push.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in the \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m function. Let me\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfirst\u001b[9Gread\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Gcurrent\u001b[26Gimplementation\u001b[41Gand\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gtests\u001b[55Gto\u001b[58Gunderstand\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gwhat\u001b[8Gneeds to change.\u001b[25G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[17G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I can see\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gissue.\u001b[28GThe\u001b[32G\u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[44G\u001b[39mfunction\u001b[53Guses\u001b[58Ginteger\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdivision\u001b[12G(\u001b[38;5;105m//\u001b[39m),\u001b[18Gwhich\u001b[24Gtruncates\u001b[34Gtoward\u001b[41Gzero.\u001b[47GThe\u001b[51Gtest\u001b[56Gexpects\u001b[64Git\u001b[67Gto\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gr\u001b[5Gund\u001b[9Gh\u001b[11Glf up\u001b[17Ginstead (73.5 should become 74, n\u001b[51Gt\u001b[53G73).\u001b[58G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI'll fix this\u001b[17Gby using Python's \u001b[38;5;105mDecimal\u001b[39m module with \u001b[38;5;105mROUND_HALF_UP\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mrounding:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=j806qk;file:///root/nonna-app/app/money.py\u0007app/money.py\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
